flowchart TD
  hook[Existing tasks.script / check hook] --> lock[Hold group lock for whole native run]
  lock --> inventory[Pin candidate and inventory owned / unrelated resources]
  inventory --> release[Validate every owned resource then scoped release]
  release --> snapshot[Export pinned source to disposable checkout]
  snapshot --> prepare[Harness reserve / boot / mount; offline owned Gateway resize to 2560MiB, boot and wait for agent; not ready]
  prepare --> fixture[Shared fixture bootstrap: Swamp then Gateway, canonical firewall baseline, trust, observers and projection queue]
  fixture --> readiness[Authenticated operator HTTP; native SSH probe; fresh facts; scoped Doctor baseline]
  readiness --> result[Publish generation, readiness and preservation evidence]
  result --> cases{Verification run?}
  cases -->|yes| commands[Run real candidate CLI cases; scoped case cleanup]
  cases -->|no| held[Keep generation for explicit test use]
  commands --> baseline[Compare scoped database and firewall baseline; reject case residue]
  baseline --> receipt[Record actual case exit; release group lock]
  held --> receipt
  prepare -. failure .-> diagnose[Retain bounded nonsecret diagnostics; timeouts do not skip release]
  fixture -. failure .-> diagnose
  readiness -. failure .-> diagnose
  diagnose --> ownedCleanup[Release only this generation; preserve failure]
  ownedCleanup --> receipt
